# Copy this to devices.local and fill in your device UDIDs.
# devices.local is gitignored — never push real UDIDs.
#
# How to find UDID:
#   - Connect device via USB
#   - Xcode → Window → Devices and Simulators
#   - Or: system_profiler SPUSBDataType | grep -A 11 "iPhone\|iPad"
#
# Leave blank to skip device install (simulators will open instead).

